Package: miadi-kit
Version: 0.1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, git
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: One command that updates the Miadi kit's plugins in every harness
 miadi-kit update, run by each account, updates every plugin from
 jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit that the account has installed in Claude
 Code, Codex, Copilot CLI, Gemini CLI and Pi, each with that harness's own
 command, and fast-forwards a kit checkout that a harness reads in place.
 miadi-kit update --check says what would move and changes nothing.
 Installing the package changes no home directory. The harnesses and their
 sign-in stay with each account.
